</h2>

<ul>

<li>
Why do you want to study the Bible?
</li>

<li>
What do you hope to learn about God?
</li>

<li>
Which area of your life needs greater
wisdom and guidance?
</li>

<li>
What can you do to make Bible study
a consistent part of your life?
</li>

</ul>

